@segment  return
@title    Ending — Return to Waking
@levels   F10
@fixed
@continuous-exit default
@duration ~2m30s

say Your body is still relaxed, and you remain at peace.
pause 5
say You'll return now to full physical waking reality as I count from ten down to one.
pause 5
say When I reach the count of one, all of your five physical senses will be operating clearly, cleanly, sharply, and beautifully.
pause 2
say You'll be completely wide awake, both physically and mentally, feeling completely refreshed, feeling better in every way, all when I reach the count of one.
pause 6
say I'm going to count now.
pause 4
say Ten.
pause 3
say Nine.
pause 3
say Eight.
pause 3
say Seven.
pause 5
say When I reach the count of one, all of your five physical senses will be operating clearly, cleanly, sharply, and beautifully.
pause 2
say You'll be completely wide awake, both physically and mentally, full of new energy, feeling better in every way, all when I reach the count of one.
pause 6
say Six.
pause 3
say Five.
pause 3
say Four.
pause 3
say Three.
pause 3
say Two.
pause 3
say One.
pause 4
say Wake up, open your eyes, breathe deeply, and stretch your arms and legs.
pause 8
say And that completes the exercise.
pause 4
